# Sample clip the Simulator frame source plays. Not committed: this repo has no
# LFS, and a video binary in history is not removable. Supply it locally at
# frontend/ios/TPD/Media/sample_rally.mp4 — the app shows a retryable empty
# state when it is absent.
frontend/ios/TPD/Media/*.mp4
frontend/ios/build/
